abstract: >-
  This repository contains the MATLAB source code, benchmark datasets, 
  and experimental results for the paper: "A Mixed-Integer Optimization 
  Approach for Finite 2D Tiling Problems". It implements an MI-SOCP 
  framework to solve geometric Tangram puzzles by mapping continuous 
  search spaces to discrete lattice grids.
